Thanks.

499
00:32:46,260 --> 00:32:49,000
<i>I have to secure time for rehearsals.</i>

500
00:32:49,450 --> 00:32:51,510
<i>But I need to think about her health, too.</i>

501
00:32:52,030 --> 00:32:54,620
<i>And Kana graduates at the end of the year.</i>

502
00:32:54,620 --> 00:32:57,280
<i>How do we replace her in B-Komachi?</i>

503
00:32:59,190 --> 00:33:02,540
<i>As a business owner, 
I should push her as hard as I can.</i>

504
00:33:03,270 --> 00:33:05,980
<i>But what about as her mother?</i>

505
00:33:05,540 --> 00:33:06,630
Congratulations
Entrance Ceremony
Youtou High School

506
00:33:08,510 --> 00:33:11,350
<i>Showbiz is in a constant state of churn.</i>

507
00:33:11,350 --> 00:33:14,090
<i>Most entertainers end up 
as a flash in the pan.</i>

508
00:33:14,470 --> 00:33:19,080
<i>Even if you gain a little fame, it can 
all fade away in just a year's time.</i>

509
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:26,900
Congratulations
Entrance Ceremony
Youtou High School

510
00:33:20,730 --> 00:33:24,030
<i>There's no doubt that her efforts now</i>

511
00:33:24,030 --> 00:33:26,480
