Ichigo, what would you have done?

522
00:33:50,420 --> 00:33:53,140
Samidare

523
00:33:56,260 --> 00:33:58,800
Barkeep, get me the usual.

524
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:02,400
Yeah, yeah. The meat'n'veggies set 
with a small rice.

525
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:04,690
And some mixed veggie juice,

526
00:34:04,690 --> 00:34:06,380
extra kale.

527
00:34:06,380 --> 00:34:08,650
Could you order some 
damn booze for a change?

528
00:34:08,950 --> 00:34:11,090
We're not a diner.

529
00:34:12,030 --> 00:34:16,240
This is the only place I can get 
a proper meal this late at night.

530
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:22,270
Jeez. Take better care of yourself, 
or you'll die from overwork.

531
00:34:22,270 --> 00:34:26,240
I'd much rather that than let 
one of our talent die from overwork.

532
00:34:27,130 --> 00:34:31,800
Are your kids eating right? 
They're really busy now, yeah?

533
00:34:32,090 --> 00:34:38,710
Mhm. Their manager 
should be taking care of that.

534
00:34:38,710 --> 00:34:40,470
You left it all to someone else?

535
00:34:40,980 --> 00:34:44,490
If you don't look them in the eye 
and keep your arms wide open,

536
00:34:44,490 --> 00:34:46,900
you'll miss the crucial signs.

537
00:34:47,470 --> 00:34:52,700
I get that, but they never 
wear their hearts on their sleeve.

538
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:58,900
My son's always deadpan, 
my daughter's always all smiles,

539
00:34:58,900 --> 00:35:01,190
and they never complain.

540
00:35:02,190 --> 00:35:05,570
I have no way to tell 
what they're thinking deep down.

541
