I'm not their real mother, after all.

542
00:35:12,300 --> 00:35:16,160
I wanna watch them up close 
all the time too, you know!

543
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:19,140
I'm not built for all this brainy work!

544
00:35:20,100 --> 00:35:22,980
How I'd love to go back 
to being just a manager if I could!

545
00:35:23,940 --> 00:35:26,940
But this company needs me to do this!

546
00:35:27,340 --> 00:35:29,570
We don't have anybody else to rely on!

547
00:35:30,570 --> 00:35:31,320
Barkeep.

548
00:35:31,940 --> 00:35:33,310
Long time noâ€”

549
00:35:35,540 --> 00:35:37,530
Ichigo...?

550
00:35:42,000 --> 00:35:43,160
Get back here!

551
00:35:43,160 --> 00:35:45,400
I'll be back later!

552
