00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:42,310
Don't let Miyako catch you

681
00:43:39,600 --> 00:43:42,310
I'm here

682
00:43:42,390 --> 00:43:43,890
Samidare

683
00:43:43,890 --> 00:43:48,360
He was the one who summoned me 
to Miyako's favorite bar that night.

684
00:43:50,740 --> 00:43:52,150
And what do I find...

685
