787
00:49:24,860 --> 00:49:28,010
Huh? There are still some 
empty spaces in the cast list.

788
00:49:28,010 --> 00:49:29,570
Oh, you're right.

789
00:49:29,860 --> 00:49:32,100
Yeah, those are the kid roles.

790
00:49:32,100 --> 00:49:34,780
We just haven't been able 
to pencil those in.

791
00:49:36,580 --> 00:49:40,620
It's so hard to find good child actors.

792
00:49:40,620 --> 00:49:45,680
I've been screening them 
all over the country, but no dice.

793
00:49:45,680 --> 00:49:49,970
They stick out like a sore thumb when 
you give them lines in a serious movie.

794
00:49:49,970 --> 00:49:53,410
Child actors who can handle long lines 
with ease are worth their weight in gold.

795
00:49:53,410 --> 00:49:54,970
I know what you mean.

796
00:49:54,970 --> 00:50:01,260
Quality films need child actors as good 
as me born in the same time frame!

797
00:50:01,260 --> 00:50:05,440
Must suck so hard for this era 
to have nobody on my level!

798
00:50:05,440 --> 00:50:08,190
Look at her cling to her past glories.

799
00:50:08,740 --> 00:50:11,280
I gotta go looking right after this, too.

800
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:12,780
Good luck!

801
00:50:17,910 --> 00:50:20,710
You look like you've steeled yourself.

802
00:50:21,260 --> 00:50:25,880
To hurt people, and to be hurt in turn.

803
00:50:26,600 --> 00:50:28,400
Do you have nothing better to do?

804
00:50:28,400 --> 00:50:30,730
You keep showing up to grind my gears.

805
00:50:31,190 --> 00:50:34,970
I'm merely trying to guide you onto 
the right path toward your fate.

806
00:50:35,450 --> 00:50:38,680
Fate, eh? What are you, 
a god or something?

807
00:50:39,100 --> 00:50:44,020
Now, that depends on how 
you people define a "god."

808
00:50:44,690 --> 00:50:46,210
Different question.

809
00:50:46,210 --> 00:50:48,940
Do you have parents? A government ID?

810
00:50:49,340 --> 00:50:50,230
Of course.

811
00:50:50,930 --> 00:50:55,450
This vessel was born of a mother, 
much like you two.

812
00:50:55,910 --> 00:50:57,450
Do you want to check?

813
00:50:57,450 --> 00:50:59,660
It's just another child's body 
you'd find anywhere.

814
00:51:00,630 --> 00:51:01,940
Huh.

815
00:51:03,510 --> 00:51:04,520
What?

816
00:51:05,600 --> 00:51:06,710
Listen...

817
00:51:07,360 --> 00:51:08,800
Wanna be a child actor?

818
00:51:10,880 --> 00:51:11,750
Wha?

