00:52:46,230 --> 00:52:48,480
Open this when you're 15

822
00:52:46,570 --> 00:52:48,480
<i>...watch this together over drinks.</i>

823
00:52:48,480 --> 00:52:52,190
<i>Surely I won't still be 
an idol at that age.</i>

824
00:52:52,480 --> 00:52:56,780
<i>Oh, but you two might be.</i>

825
00:52:56,780 --> 00:52:59,870
<i>You're my kids, 
so it could totally happen.</i>

826
00:53:02,940 --> 00:53:04,560
<i>All that aside,</i>

827
00:53:05,020 --> 00:53:07,060
<i>please grow up healthy, okay?</i>

828
00:53:08,020 --> 00:53:11,450
<i>As your mom, that's my one and only wish.</i>

829
00:53:13,450 --> 00:53:16,880
<i>Whew, that was nerve-racking.</i>

830
00:53:17,580 --> 00:53:20,320
<i>I've always wanted to 
try out something like this.</i>

831
00:53:21,150 --> 00:53:23,010
<i>Oh, there's that, too.</i>

832
00:53:24,900 --> 00:53:26,120
<i>To Ruby.</i>

833
00:53:27,130 --> 00:53:30,900
<i>I have something to say to you, 
now that you're all grown up.</i>

